            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "D. The University’s failure to comply with the procedural requirements in this Article is grievable and arbitrable. However, the University’s staffing decisions are not grievable or arbitrable, nor is the modification of a staffing decision a remedy that an arbitrator can award.",
            "block_bbox": [
                111,
                1021,
                1121,
